                        "language": "english",
                        "review": "The game has a great cultural background very well implemented; it starts with the mechanics and reaches its visual and musical style.\n\nI liked the way everything is mixed, the variety of characters, the gameplay mechanics and the game's main goal.\n\nOf course, there's room for improvement and I've reached the developers about it. The good news is that they have plans to work on some of those improvements to give us all a better experience.\n\nIf you enjoy games that have a cultural background as well as fighting games, I'd recomment it. \n\nNOTE: This game is fcking hard to grasp, and even harder to master. So, if you're looking for a challenge, you're up for it.\n\nGOOD LUCK IN TRYING TO WIN YOUR FIRST MATCH \n\nPS: Hey devs, that should be a good achievement to implement, haha!",
